### Normaler Test – alle Werte = mittlerer Bereich
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bfi10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionID": "bfi-normal",
  "q1": 3,
  "q2": 3,
  "q3": 3,
  "q4": 3,
  "q5": 3,
  "q6": 3,
  "q7": 3,
  "q8": 3,
  "q9": 3,
  "q10": 3
}



### Extrem-Test – Kommentare entfernt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bfi10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionID": "bfi-extreme",
  "q1": 5,
  "q2": 1,
  "q3": 1,
  "q4": 1,
  "q5": 5,
  "q6": 1,
  "q7": 5,
  "q8": 5,
  "q9": 5,
  "q10": 1
}


### Fehler-Test – ungültiger Wert (z. B. q1 = 7)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bfi10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionID": "bfi-invalid-value",
  "q1": 7,
  "q2": 3,
  "q3": 3,
  "q4": 3,
  "q5": 3,
  "q6": 3,
  "q7": 3,
  "q8": 3,
  "q9": 3,
  "q10": 3
}



### Fehler-Test – fehlender Wert (z. B. q10 fehlt)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bfi10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionID": "bfi-missing-value",
  "q1": 3,
  "q2": 3,
  "q3": 3,
  "q4": 3,
  "q5": 3,
  "q6": 3,
  "q7": 3,
  "q8": 3,
  "q9": 3
  // q10 fehlt → sollte Validierungsfehler werfen
}



### Fehler-Test – sessionID fehlt (NotBlank verletzt)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bfi10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "q1": 3,
  "q2": 3,
  "q3": 3,
  "q4": 3,
  "q5": 3,
  "q6": 3,
  "q7": 3,
